# Implementation Plan — Phase 2: Production Readiness & Real School Pilot

Transition the existing School Alumni Management and Batch Get-Together Platform ("JustGatherNow") from **developer-complete MVP** to a **hardened, production-ready system for ABC School** capable of supporting 500 alumni initially and scaling to 5,000+ alumni.

Phase 2 focuses strictly on **reliability, security, real data processing, production environment hardening, and pilot execution** without adding unnecessary new feature bloat.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Environment Fail-Fast & Secret Enforcement**:
> - In `production` environment (`APP_ENV=production`), the application will **NEVER** silently fall back to an in-memory database or default JWT secret. If MongoDB or required secrets are missing, startup will fail immediately with clear system logs.
> - Production CORS will restrict origins strictly to configured domains (e.g. `https://alumni.abcschool.edu`).

> [!NOTE]
> **Real Alumni Data Import & Duplicate Handling**:
> - Enhanced CSV Import provides a validation summary (Total, Valid, Duplicates, Invalid) and exports an Error CSV for rows failing validation.
> - Ambiguous duplicates (matching mobile, email, or admission number) are flagged for admin review rather than merged automatically.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Event Capacity & Overbooking Prevention**:
> - RSVP submission will check event `max_capacity`. If `current_expected + new_guests > max_capacity`, the API blocks the request with `409 Conflict` (Prevent Overbooking) unless overridden by a School Admin.

